# Analytics and Security Integration – Inventory Management Software

## Feature 1: Sales and Inventory Trend Analysis

### Description
This feature analyzes sales and inventory records to show how product demand changes over time. It helps the business understand which products are selling more or less frequently.

### How the Feature Works
The system collects information from completed sales and inventory records. It compares the number of units sold over different periods, such as daily, weekly, or monthly. The results can be displayed in simple charts or reports, allowing the business to identify products with increasing or decreasing demand and make better inventory decisions.

